flowchart TD
    HUMAN[Authorized human intent] --> SURFACE[Discord · Slack · Telegram · AGK UI · CLI]
    SURFACE --> GATE[Station identity · Zone · Project · capability policy]
    GATE --> HERMES[Hermes central brain<br/>Zone-isolated HERMES_HOME]
    HERMES --> ATLAS[Atlas / Project Manager<br/>durable mission + work record]
    ATLAS --> ARCH[Architect<br/>contracts · ADR · rollback]
    ARCH --> FORGE[Forge<br/>worktree · code · tests]
    FORGE --> SENTINEL[Sentinel<br/>independent review · QA · security]
    SENTINEL --> RELEASE[Release Engineer<br/>CI · artifact · staging · approved promotion]
    RELEASE --> SRE[SRE<br/>health · user path · incident · recovery]
    SRE --> EVIDENCE[Evidence ladder<br/>observed → verified → read back → accepted]
    EVIDENCE --> ATLAS

    HERMES --> ROUTES[Replaceable LLM/provider routes]
    HERMES --> TOOLS[Typed tools<br/>GitHub · Vercel · Composio · native APIs]
    HERMES --> GATEWAY[Single Hermes messaging Gateway]
    TOOLS --> REAL[Repositories · CI · cloud · Discord API · services]
    REAL --> EVIDENCE
    HUMAN -. exact production/destructive approval .-> RELEASE

    COMPOSIO[Composio Discord<br/>Zone-scoped tool adapter] --> TOOLS
    SDK[discord.js 14.27.0<br/>isolated SDK, no Gateway] --> TOOLS
